Action: prune_redundant  
Action Input: {"pool":"pool_full","corr_threshold":0.95,"metric":"rmse"}

Thought: The ranking is unstable and many models are correlated; a robust weighted combination on the most stable subset may improve over trimmed mean.  
Action: weights_inverse_error  
